|content6=
* January 29th - '''Vexed Gaming''' sign [[Russ]]. <ref name="russ joins">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Vexed_GG/status/1222580503909486593|date=2020-01-29|title=Please join us in welcoming @Russ_CS to the Vexed Gaming Family.|author='''Vexed Gaming'''}}</ref>
