* April 26th - '''Vexed Gaming''' acquire [[Reason Gaming]]'s roster. <ref name="Vexed Gaming sign Reason Gaming">{{cite web|url=https://www.vexed.gg/vexed-sign-ex-reason-csgo/|title=Vexed sign Reason|date=2020-04-26|author='''Vexed Gaming'''}}</ref>
*May 14th - '''Vexed Gaming''' part ways with their team due to personal issues within the squad. <ref name="vexed release 2nd 2020 squad">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Vexed_GG/status/1260976384232566786|title=It's with a heavy heart that today we announce our departure from #CSGO.|date=2020-05-14|author='''Vexed Gaming'''}}</ref>
* August 31st - '''Vexed Gaming''' acquire the lineup of [[Project 5 Esport]]. <ref name="vexed 3rd 2020">{{cite web|url=https://www.vexed.gg/csgo-roster-announcement-2020-2021/|title=CSGO ROSTER 2020/2021|date=2020-08-31|publisher=[[Vexed Gaming]]}}</ref>
* October 9th - '''Vexed Gaming''' part ways with [[shateri]]. <ref name="shateri leaves">{{cite web|url=https://www.twitlonger.com/show/n_1sre6vq|title=Parting ways with Vexed|date=2020-10-09|author=[[shateri]]}}</ref>
* October 22nd - '''Vexed Gaming''' signs [[EIZA]]. <ref name="+eiza">{{cite web|url=https://www.vexed.gg/csgo-roster-update-22-10-2020/|title=CSGO ROSTER UPDATE 22-10-2020|date=2020-10-22|publisher=[[Vexed Gaming]]}}</ref>

|content5=
* January 16th - [[sprayxd]] steps down as '''Vexed Gaming''''s coach. <ref name="spray down">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/sprayxdCS/status/1086028837371236356|date=2019-01-16|title=with that being said, i will no longer be part of @Vexed_GG |author=[[sprayxd]]}}</ref>
* January 28th - [[kolor]] replaces [[ozzy]]. <ref name="kolor replaces ozzy">{{cite web|url=https://www.vexed.gg/vexed-csgo-roster-update-2019/|date=2019-01-28|title=Vexed CSGO Roster Update 2019|publisher=[[Vexed Gaming]]}}</ref>
* March 12th - [[kolor]] is acquired by [[Budapest Five]]. <ref name="kolor leaves">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/BudapestFive/status/1105522462463279104|title=Today we are announcing our CS:GO roster under Budapest Five!|date=2019-03-12|publisher=[[Budapest Five]]}}</ref>
* May 8th - [[The Final Tribe]] acquire '''Vexed Gaming'''<nowiki>'s</nowiki> roster. <ref name="vexed to tft">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/thefinaltribe/status/1126139670453280768|title=We're incredibly excited to announce that we have expanded into yet another prominent #esport !|date=2019-05-08|author=[[The Final Tribe]]}}</ref>
* June 3rd - '''Vexed Gaming''' acquire [[London Esports]]<nowiki>'</nowiki> roster. <ref name="london es to vexed">{{cite web|url=https://www.vexed.gg/vexed-announce-new-uk-csgo-roster/|title=Vexed announce new CSGO roster|date=2019-06-03|author='''Vexed Gaming'''}}</ref>
* July 23rd - [[SHANEY]] joins as a streamer. <ref name="shaney streamer">{{cite web |url=https://twitter.com/Vexed_GG/status/1153714278723137536 |title=Please join us welcoming an absolute unreal FPL gamer and OG Vexed Gaming Awper @shaneyCSGO back to Vexed Gaming as he joins our ever growing Stream Team! |author='''Vexed Gaming''' |date=2019-07-23}}</ref>
* August 14th - [[Vexed Gaming]] bench [[frazehh]]. [[ec1s]] joins the team on a trial basis. <ref name="ec1s trial">{{cite web|url=https://www.vexed.gg/counterstrike-roster-update-14-08-2019/|title=Counterstrike Roster update |date=2019-08-14 |publisher=[[Vexed Gaming]]}}</ref>
* December 16th - [[Vexed Gaming]] release [[ec1s]]. <ref name="ec1s leaves">{{cite web|url=https://www.vexed.gg/ec1s-released-from-active-lineup/|title=EC1S Released from active lineup|date=2019-12-16|author='''Vexed Gaming'''}}</ref>
* September 7th - [[frazehh]] leaves '''Vexed Gaming''' to join [[London Esports]]. <ref name="frazehh london">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/LDN_Esports/status/1170418961801981953|date=2019-09-07|title=We are happy to announce our CS:GO roster has had a few tweaks and improvements!|author=[[London Esports]]}}</ref>

|content4=
* March 9th - [[Gauthierlele]] leaves '''Vexed Gaming'''. <ref name="Gauthierlele leaves">{{cite web|url=http://www.vakarm.net/breve/read/gAUTHIERLELE-quitte-Vexed/1386|date=2018-03-09|title=gAUTHIERLELE quitte Vexed|trans_title=gAUTHIERLELE leaves Vexed|language={{Flag|fr}} French|author=[[Dorian Costanzo]]|publisher=[[VaKarM.net]]}}</ref>
* May 28th - '''Vexed Gaming''' parts ways with their French roster. <ref name="French roster gone">{{cite web|url=http://www.vexed.gg/vexed-part-ways-french-csgo-roster/|date=2018-03-09|title=Vexed part ways with French CS:GO roster|publisher=[[Vexed Gaming]]}}</ref>
* September 9th - '''Vexed Gaming''' sign their new CS:GO squad consisting of [[pyth]], [[hns]], and the [[Vexed Gaming.uk]] core. Additionally, [[wh1sk]] joins as a substitute for UK-based events and [[sprayxd]] joins as coach. <ref name="vexed gaming winter 2018">{{cite web|url=http://www.vexed.gg/csgo-2018-winter-roster/|date=2018-09-09|title=Vexed CSGO 2018 Winter Season|publisher=[[Vexed Gaming]]}}</ref>
* December 3rd - '''Vexed Gaming''' release [[wh1sk]]. <ref name="wh1sk leaves">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/wh1skcsgo/status/1069628342989668352|date=2018-12-03|title=Vexed release wh1sk|publisher=[[wh1sk]]}}</ref>

|content3=
* February 4th - [[devoduvek]] is acquired by '''[[Team EnVyUs]]'''. <ref name="devoduvek joins nV">{{cite web|url=https://teamenvyus.com/blogs/news/changes-to-envy-cs-go |date=2017-02-04|title=Changes to EnVy CS:GO |publisher=[[Team EnVyUs]]}}</ref>
* February 19th - [[AmaNEk]] and [[hAdji]] are released from the team while [[AlluM3tt3]] and [[Smyli]] join. [[NpK]] becomes an active player. <ref name="CSGO Roster Update">{{cite web|url=http://www.vexedmultigaming.com/team-vexed/goodbye-and-welcome-csgo-roster-update/ |date=2017-02-19|title=Goodbye and Welcome.. CSGO Roster Update |publisher=[[Vexed Gaming]]}}</ref>
* March 13th - [[WiPR]] joins as analyst. <ref name="WiPR joins">{{cite web|url=http://www.vexedmultigaming.com/team-vexed/wipr-joins-vexed-as-csgo-analyst/ |date=2017-03-13|title=WiPR joins Vexed as CSGO analyst|publisher=[[Vexed Gaming]]}}</ref>
* May 1st - [[KQLY]] replaces [[AlluM3tt3]] on a trial basis. <ref name="KQLY joins">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/20344-kqly-joins-vexed-on-trial|date=2017-05-01|title=KQLY joins Vexed on trial|publisher=[[HLTV]]}}</ref> As a result of [[KQLY]]'s addition [[Smyli]] and [[jarod]] exit the team<ref name="Smyli, jarod step down from Vexed">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/20346-jarod-smyli-step-down-from-vexed|date=2017-05-01|title=Smyli, jarod step down from Vexed|publisher=[[HLTV]]}}</ref>, followed by their analyst [[WiPR]]. <ref name="WiPR leaves">{{cite web|url=http://www.twitlonger.com/show/n_1spr9q2|date=2017-05-01|title=Départ de Vexed|author=[[WiPR]]|language={{Flag|fr}} French|trans_title=Vexed departure}}</ref>
* September 25th - '''Vexed Gaming''' finalises its roster. <ref name="vexed officialises it's roster">{{cite web|url=http://www.vexedmultigaming.com/team-vexed/vexed-csgo-fr-confirm-roster/|date=2017-09-25|title=Vexed CSGO FR Confirm Roster|publisher=[[Vexed Gaming]]}}</ref>

|content2=
* February 3rd - '''Vexed Gaming''' officially announce [[repo]] as the fifth member of the team <ref name="Vexed sign repo">{{cite web|url=http://vexedgaming.com/articles/news/gaming/11/repo-the-5th-element-|title=Repo: the 5th element|date=2016-02-03|author=[[Rasmus Thorsted]]|publisher=Vexed Gaming}}</ref> and the addition of [[KubiK]] as their coach. <ref name="KubiK joins as coach">{{cite web|url=https://www.facebook.com/vexedgg/photos/a.415435488644478.1073741828.412062625648431/469606016560758/?type=3&theater|date=2016-02-03|publisher=Vexed Gaming}}</ref>
* March 8th - '''Vexed Gaming''' releases their roster with immediate effect <ref name="Vexed releases roster">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/17292-vexed-and-squad-part-ways |date=2016-03-08 |title=Vexed and squad part ways |author=[[LucasAM]]|publisher=[[HLTV]]}}</ref>. It is later revealed that '''Vexed''' would be shutting down all eSports operations. <ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.thescoreesports.com/hearthstone/news/6638 |date=2016-03-08 |title=Vexed shuts down eSports operations, drops CS:GO and Hearthstone teams |author=[[Josh Bury]] |publisher=[[theScore eSports]]}}</ref>
* December 5th - '''Vexed Gaming''' re-enters CS:GO with the signing of the French team '''[[WE GOT GAME]]'''. <ref name="vexed sign wgg">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/19395-vexed-sign-former-platinium-squad |date=2016-12-05 |title=Vexed sign former Platinium squad |author=[[Professeur]]|publisher=[[HLTV]]}}</ref>

|content1=
* September 16th - [[Team eBettle]] rebrands its gaming arm as Vexed Gaming, in order to avoid potential betting-related controversy. <ref name="eBettle becomes Vexed Gaming">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/15963-ebettle-becomes-vexed-gaming|title=eBettle becomes Vexed Gaming|date=2015-09-16|author=[[MIRAA]]|publisher=[[HLTV]]}}</ref>
* December 10th - '''Vexed Gaming''' release [[peet]], while announcing that [[MINISE]] of ex-[[ESC]] will be standing in for them in the near future. <ref name="Vexed release peet">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/16596-vexed-release-peet|title=Vexed release peet|date=2015-12-10|author=[[MIRAA]]|publisher=[[HLTV]]}}</ref>  In actuality, [[repo]] begins playing as the teams fifth.
}}

